(text "STEMMA QT cable\nred = 3V3    -> Pico pin 36\nblue = SDA   -> Pico pin 6\nyellow = SCL -> Pico pin 7\nblack = GND  -> Pico pin 8" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 68.58 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6ec93e9f-b4df-5b98-9f3b-9544d149219b"))
(text "Red F/F jumper\nU2 header 3Vo -> U3 3V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "feb73150-4c0b-5bf0-8f6c-a224b0c3192b"))
(text "3Vo is the output of U2's on-board regulator, fed by\nthe Pico's 3V3 through the STEMMA QT cable. It powers U3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "98a94cc2-644e-5e5d-8af3-8329f645c7fe"))
(text "F/F jumpers on Pico pins 21-24\npin 21 yellow = BCLK\npin 22 brown  = LRCL\npin 23 black  = GND\npin 24 orange = DOUT\nred = 3V, from U2 3Vo" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 177.8 130.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8c5fb8fe-25f7-524f-b2d3-c5f994a8f4cf"))
(text "SEL left open: pulled low on the\nbreakout = left channel (mono)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 208.28 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "21ee7dd8-0ba4-562d-a00a-4b1efe00a209"))
(text "Power: 5.1 V micro-USB supply into the Pico's USB socket.\nAll sensor wiring is 3.3 V. Do not connect anything to VBUS/VSYS." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e22ee79d-1c98-5543-8bc7-14c504a327b0"))
